		 * replacing the default `sinsp_state_sc_set()` enforcement with the alternative
		 * `sinsp_repair_state_sc_set`. This approach only activates additional syscalls Falco needs
		 * beyond the syscalls defined in each Falco rule that are absolutely necessary based on the
